** 32 (Minden) Battery

*19th Regiment Royal Artillery 'The Highland Gunners' (Armoured Artillery)
**13 (Martinique 1809) HQ Battery 
** 19/5 (Gibraltar 1779&amp;ndash;1783) Battery 
** 28/143 Battery (Tomb's Troop) 
