*32nd Regiment Royal Artillery (Surveillance and Target Acquisition &amp;ndash; Unmanned Air Vehicles)
**18 (Quebec 1759) Battery 
** 22 (Gibraltar 1779&amp;ndash;1783) Battery 
** 42 (Alem Hamza) Battery 
** 46 (Talavera) HQ Battery 
