==External links==
* [http://www.army.mod.uk/royalartillery/ Royal Regiment of Artillery]
* [http://www.duffy-eu.com/94loc/index.htm /94 Locating Royal Artillery]

[[Category:British administrative corps]]</text>
    </revision>
