  <page>
    <title>Vivendi</title>
    <id>83401</id>
    <revision>
      <id>39268988</id>
      <timestamp>2006-02-12T00:04:48Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Agateller</username>
        <id>536360</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Vivendi''' may refer to:

* [[Vivendi SA]], formerly ''[[Compagnie Générale des Eaux]],'' Merged with [[Seagram]] and [[Canal Plus|Canal+]] in 2000 to form [[Vivendi Universal]]
* [[Vivendi Universal]], the current media conglomerate formed by Vivendi/Seagram/Canal merger
* [[Veolia Environnement|Vivendi Environnement]], the former water and waste division of Vivendi
* [[Veolia Water|Vivendi Water]], a former Vivendi corporation, now part of Veolia Environnement
* [[VIVENDI]], a software package by CONNEXT

{{disambiguation}}


[[ja:ヴィヴェンディ]]</text>
