|[[Israel]] || [[Image:DP yellow.png]] Only in wartime || 1962 || 0 || Crimes Against Humanity &lt;sup&gt;[http://www.israellawcenter.org/news111402.shtml]&lt;/sup&gt; || Abolished for other crimes in 1954; only one execution ([[Adolf Eichmann]]). Targetted political assassinations occasionally do take place, but not listed as part of death penalty.
