      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Detective Casey''' is a fictional character in the [[Mickey Mouse universe]]. He is [[Chief O'Hara]]'s head detective, first appearing in ''The Plumber's Helpers''.  Despite his occupation he is not the brightest detective in the world. That's why Chief O'Hara recruits [[Mickey Mouse]] to solve some of his cases.

