      <minor />
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Pflip''' is [[Eega Beeva]]'s dog in the fictional [[Mickey Mouse universe]].

==Facts==
*Pflif has a color warning system which lets him turn red when there's danger nearby.
*Pflif's normal color is pink.
*Pflip sometimes goes on adventures with Eega Beeva and [[Mickey Mouse]].


