  <page>
    <title>Route 34 (New Jersey)</title>
    <id>83564</id>
    <revision>
      <id>40505038</id>
      <timestamp>2006-02-21T01:24:18Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Alansohn</username>
        <id>118722</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>avoid redir intended for [[Old Bridge Township, New Jersey]]</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Circle sign 34.svg|right|150px]]
'''New Jersey State Highway 34''' is a highway in central [[New Jersey]]. It runs along the east side of [[Freehold Township, New Jersey]] from [[United States Highway 9|U.S. 9]] in [[Old Bridge Township, New Jersey]] to [[Brielle Circle]], the junction of [[New Jersey State Highway 35|NJ 35]] and [[New Jersey State Highway 70|NJ 70]] in [[Wall Township, New Jersey]].

Route 34 has a brief [[concurrency (road)|concurrency]] with [[Route 33 (New Jersey)|Route 33]] in [[Farmingdale, New Jersey]] north of the [[Collingswood Circle]].

{{njsr box|before=33|beforeother=|title=34|after=35|afterother=}}

[[Category:State Routes in New Jersey|034]]</text>
