      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Circle sign 35.svg|right|150px]]
'''New Jersey State Highway 35''' is a state highway along [[New Jersey]]'s Atlantic coast. It runs from the entrance to [[Island Beach State Park, New Jersey|Island Beach State Park]] in [[Berkeley Township, New Jersey]] to an intersection with [[New Jersey State Highway 27|NJ 27]] in [[Rahway, New Jersey]]. In [[South Amboy, New Jersey]] and [[Sayreville, New Jersey]], NJ 35 is multiplexed with [[United States Highway 9|US 9]].

