      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Cleodaeus''' was one of the [[Heracleidae]], a grandson of [[Heracles]].  He led the third attempt to capture [[Mycenae]] and failed.

{{Greek-myth-stub}}

