      <contributor>
        <username>GeeJo</username>
        <id>296804</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Procles''' was one of the [[Heracleidae]], a great-great-great-grandson of [[Heracles]], and a son of [[Aristodemus]].  His twin was [[Eurysthenes]], and together they received the land of [[Lacedaemon]] after [[Cresphontes]]. [[Temenus]] and [[Oxylus]] captured the [[Peloponnesus]].

{{Greek-myth-stub}}

[[Category:Heracleidae]]
[[fr:Proclès]]</text>
    </revision>
