        <id>296804</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Assaracus''' was the second son of King [[Tros]] of [[Dardania (Asia minor)|Dardania]]. He inherited the throne when his elder brother [[Ilus]] preferred to reign instead over his newly founded city of [[Ilium]] (which also became known as [[Troy]]).

Assaracus' son and heir was [[Capys]].

{{Greek-myth-stub}}

[[Category:Trojans]]
[[Category:Greek mythological people]]

[[it:Assaraco]]</text>
