      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:Circle sign 38.svg|right|150px]]
'''New Jersey State Highway 38''' is a state highway in the southern part of [[New Jersey]]. It extends from a circle where it intersects [[United States Highway 30|U.S. 30]] and [[United States Highway 130|U.S. 130]] in [[Pennsauken, New Jersey]] to [[United States Highway 206|U.S. 206]] in [[Southampton, New Jersey]].

{{njsr box|before=37|beforeother=|title=38|after=US 40|afterother=[[Route 39 (New Jersey)|39]]}}

[[Category:State Routes in New Jersey|038]]</text>
