      <minor />
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Hylaeus''' and '''Rheacus''' were two [[centaur]]s who tried to rape [[Atalanta]].  They were killed by [[Meleager]].

{{Greek-myth-stub}}

