      <comment>{{Greek-myth-stub}}</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Learches''' (alternatively '''Learchus''') was a son of [[Athamus]] and [[Ino]].  He was killed by his father, who had been driven insane by [[Hera]] as punishment for having raised [[Dionysus]], [[Zeus]]'s son by [[Semele]].


{{Greek-myth-stub}}
[[Category:Greek mythological people]]</text>
