        <username>Jacobolus</username>
        <id>166386</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Ackermann''' may refer to:

*[[Anton Ackermann]], (1905–1973) German foreign minister
*[[Ernst Christian Wilhelm Ackermann]] (1761&amp;ndash;1835), Bohemian public servant
*[[Franz Ackermann]] (born 1963), abstract artist
*[[Georg Christian Benedict Ackermann]] (1763&amp;ndash;1833), German theologian 
*[[Georg Friedrich Ackermann]] (1787&amp;ndash;1843), German landscape painter
*[[Hans Ackermann]] (16th century), German dramatist
*[[Jacob Fidelis Ackermann]] (1765&amp;ndash;1815), German doctor
*[[Johann Ackermann]] (15th century), Bohemian author
*[[Johann Adam Ackermann]] (1780&amp;ndash;1853), German landscape painter
*[[Johann Christian Gottlieb Ackermann]] (1756&amp;ndash;1801), German doctor
*German acting family:
**[[Konrad Ernst Ackermann]] (1712&amp;ndash;1771)
**[[Sophie Charlotte Ackermann]] (1714&amp;ndash;1792)
**[[Dorothea Ackermann]] (born 1752)
**[[Marie Magdalene Charlotte Ackermann]] (1757&amp;ndash;1775)
*[[Leopold Ackermann]] (Petrus Fouresius) (1771&amp;ndash;1831), biblical archaeologist
*[[Ronny Ackermann]] (born 1977), skier
*[[Rosemarie Ackermann]] (born 1952), high jumper
*[[Rudolph Ackermann]] (1764&amp;ndash;1834), German book trader and inventor
*[[Wilhelm Ackermann]] (1896&amp;ndash;1962), German mathematician
*[[Wilhelm Heinrich Ackermann]] (1789&amp;ndash;1848), German teacher
*[[Louise Victorine Ackermann]] (1813&amp;ndash;1819), French poet

'''See also''':
*[[Ackermann function]]
*[[Ackerman]]
*[[Agricola]] (latinised name)

{{hndis}}

[[de:Ackermann]]
[[fr:Ackermann]]</text>
