      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Baius''' was [[Odysseus]]' helmsman.  He was buried in a bay near [[Naples, Italy|Naples]] that was then named after him: [[Baia Bay]].

{{Greek-myth-stub}}

