      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], the name '''Butes''' referred to four different people.

*[[Aphrodite]]'s lover and a [[Sicily|Sicilian]] king.  He was the father of [[Eryx]] by Aphrodite.
*[[Boreas]]' son.  He offended [[Dionysus]] and was made insane.
*Son of [[Pandion]] and [[Zeuxippe]].  He was a priest of [[Poseidon]] and [[Athena]] and was worshipped as a hero by the [[Athens, Greece|Athenians]].
*An [[Argonauts|Argonaut]], son of [[Teleon]].

[[Category:Greek mythological people]]
[[Category:Sicilian characters in Greek mythology]]

[[es:Butes]]
[[fr:Boutès fils de Pandion]]
[[uk:Бут]]</text>
