      <text xml:space="preserve">In [[Greek mythology]], '''Caunus''' was a son of [[Miletus]] and brother of [[Byblis]].  She fell in love with Caunus.  He ran away and she followed him through much of [[Greece]] and [[Asia Minor]] until she finally died, tired and sad.  She was changed into a spring.


